OL,3,ADemocrats nominate Hakeem Jeffries to
OL,4,Abe US Speaker of the House
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrats in the US House of
OL,7,FRepresentatives officially nominated
OL,8,FHakeem Jeffries to be Speaker, setting
OL,9,Fhim on the path to become the first
OL,10,Fblack lawmaker to lead the chamber.
OL,12,FThe House will elect its new Speaker on
OL,13,F3 January, when the next term begins
OL,14,Fand Democrats will be in the majority.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
