OL,3,ADemocrats nominate Hakeem Jeffries to
OL,4,Abe US Speaker of the House
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis election to the powerful position -
OL,7,Fthe Speaker is in line to succeed the
OL,8,Fpresident after the vice-president - is
OL,9,Fwidely expected. Should he win,
OL,10,FJeffries will preside over his party's
OL,11,Flargest House majority in years and
OL,12,Fbenefit from the Senate also being
OL,13,Funder Democrats' control.
OL,15,FJeffries told reporters after the vote
OL,16,Fthat the nomination was "a high honour
OL,17,Fand a distinct privilege".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
